kettle|PASS: Handled boiling-water vessel and automatic electric-kettle example support the source-only noun. Vietnamese retains the simultaneous cup arrangement. Teapot contrast describes primary use rather than an absolute material or design distinction.
proceed|PASS: Repairs after reading a plan and directions to a waiting area illustrate the two supplied continuation/movement boundaries. With and to complements are accurate; Vietnamese preserves the sequence and destination. Formal register is marked for each, with no unsupported legal proceeding noun.
thirty|PASS: Ten beyond twenty and thirty seedlings agree. Vietnamese cây con correctly translates seedlings. Cardinal, ordinal and decade/age forms are distinguished without claiming an approved numeral taxonomy.
weather|PASS: Dry conditions during roof repair represent current atmospheric conditions rather than climate. Vietnamese khô ráo and trong lúc retain content. Uncountable weather and a spell of weather explain countability without introducing a weather verb.
deserve|PASS: Volunteer recognition illustrates merit without promising a reward. Vietnamese xứng đáng được ghi nhận retains the positive result and shelter operation. Noun and infinitive complements are sound; grammar correctly allows negative consequences in other contexts.
